      "message": "test(post): move the Tormach lathe G76 goldens to a start in free air\n\nRegenerated with WRITE_GOLDEN=1 by lathe_post_tormach_thread. The G76\nworld's bar now ends at its free end face Z14.693:\n- the cycle starts at Z16 (inch Z0.6299), not Z14 (Z0.5512) in the bar;\n- the departure before G30 writes no G0 Z40 (Z1.5748): the retract at\n  Z24 already stands in front of the stock face (the #1604 departure\n  goes +Z only up to the face).\n\nRefs #2952\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
